//! The `border-radius` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property rounds the corners of an element's outer border edge. You can set a single radius to
//! make circular corners, or two radii to make elliptical corners.
//!
